lg:BE-CSA-2-20-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "4d01ae267e61581caaad9793780e3da989a63e7a64b5c4608d835ae30605ef8c" ;
    lgo:text """Art. 2:20. All deeds, invoices, announcements, notices, letters, orders, websites and other documents, whether in electronic form or not, emanating from a legal person must state the following particulars:
1° the name of the legal person;
2° the legal form, in full or abbreviated;
3° the precise indication of the seat of the legal person;
4° the enterprise number;
5° the word “register of legal persons” or the abbreviation “RPR”, followed by the indication of the court of the seat of the legal person;
6° where applicable, the e-mail address and the website of the legal person;
7° where applicable, the fact that the legal person is in liquidation."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:BE-CSA-2-20-q1 .

lg:BE-CSA-2-21-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "e773543a406be69f1c7aae84588fa4ad1d7289fb22a7bfe552d4e5d69e3e5953" ;
    lgo:text "Art. 2:21. Where, in the case of a public limited company, a European company or a European cooperative society, the websites or the documents referred to in Article 2:20 mention the capital of the company, this must be the paid-up capital as shown in the latest balance sheet. If it appears from this that the paid-up capital is impaired, the net assets as shown in the latest balance sheet must be stated. Where a higher amount has been stated than determined in accordance with the first paragraph and the company fails to fulfil its obligations, the third party concerned has the right to claim compensation for the damage suffered from the person who acted on behalf of the company in the deed or website."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:BE-CSA-2-21-q1 .

lg:BE-CSA-2-22-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "ab402c7c98dd10d0bf6051cdebe8ab69814e3b1f0afb4350167c4aaba1e171c2" ;
    lgo:text "Art. 2:22. A person who, on behalf of a legal person, contributes to a deed or website that does not comply with the rules referred to in Article 2:20 may, according to the circumstances, be held liable for the obligations entered into therein by the legal person."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:BE-CSA-2-22-q1 .

